                  "content" : [
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "never did the SIOCOUTQ part - cuz didnt appear needed and not portable. Seem to have fixed well. Key is doing the reads (eof) before close of socket, and shutdown first so reads return 0.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "And DBGTRACE if we get any extra data read from socket.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
